  version: 1
  offer: The tribes are gathering behind one chieftain. If he unites them, Trimery will face an invasion. Find the level-40 Chieftain in the northern stronghold and defeat him. Return to me here in Trimery for your reward and the title Chieftain's Bane. This hunt is optional; the city road remains yours to travel.
  activeDialogue: The Chieftain commands the upper court of the northern stronghold. Watch his overhead smash and the two guards at his side. Return to me in Trimery when he falls.
  locationHint: Northern Briarback stronghold, upper court. Return to Trimery's village elder.
